\code{spec_code}s. The synonym string alone is insufficient to uniquely
identify a species, causing a one-to-many join error in \code{\link[=query_synonyms]{query_synonyms()}}.
\item \strong{\code{accepted_status} integrity check} — groups by \code{spec_code} and detects
